            "review_text": "TazVn\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\ngood selection of wine\nAug 2019\nthis place is in a far corner and not easy to find - it is ok but the food ...well it is not a restaurant - cold cuts was fine\nthey tend to forget about you when the clock hits 11 - don't want to encourage opening another bottle at that time I guess\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 5, 2019",
